{"id":"663817","name":"低卡菜苔牛肉拌饭","author":"阳春白雪！","authorId":"10904953","desc":"","cover":"images/663817/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菜苔","amount":"200g"},{"name":"熟牛肉","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白胡椒粉","amount":"1g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备菜苔200克，米饭100克，卤牛肉切丁。","img":"images/663817/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"菜苔切段焯水二十秒捞出备用。","img":"images/663817/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"喷油，菜苔炒香，加盐，胡椒粉。","img":"images/663817/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入米饭牛肉混合翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/663817/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"低脂低卡。","img":"images/663817/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"吃瘦不饿瘦。","img":"images/663817/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"减脂餐必备。","img":"images/663817/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}